# Owner wallets (Mando's) and anything derived from them — H3 Wallet Discovery
# Spec v1.0 §0: they exist only in the personal-history replay, never in the repo.
# Ignored BEFORE any such file exists, so the first write cannot be committed by
# accident. Verify with: git check-ignore -v barrel/private/anything
private/

# Data-source credentials (Dune API key etc.). Created by Mando, never by the
# builder; read from the environment, never printed or logged.
.env
